      "text": "Employee Badge #:    12345\nPlant Location:      PRINCETON\nPart / Model #:      12345-ABC (Prod Mon Unit)\nSerial Number:       S123456789\nFAS Cell:            A-12\nPallet Qty:          25\nClaimed Qty:         25\nSkid Weight:         1,250 lbs\nExpected Weight:     1,180 lbs\nTolerance Factor:    1.10\nVariance Allowed:    ±118 lbs\nWeight Delta:        +70 lbs (PASS)\nPallet Id:           SKD-20260905-00123\nSkid Type:           Returnable\nProd Mon Unit:       YES\n\nCombo Skid 2:\nModel:               12345-XYZ\nSerial:              S987654321\nQty:                 15\nWeight:              750 lbs",
