      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step: SkidDataComplete (DataCollectionSteps = 6)\n\n• Terminal step — no Next button\n• btnPrevious enabled → back to Skid Weight\n• btnSaveAndPrint text varies by variation:\n  - Standard/Combo: \"Print Labels\"\n  - StandardReprint/BoxLabel/MachineNumber/Location: \"Print Label\"\n  - LowVolume/KitClaiming: \"Save\"\n  - StandardExtendedModelNum: \"Print Label\"\n• btnSaveAndPrint.Enabled = no blocking exceptions\n• lblPassFail shows PASS/FAIL (visible in history/reprint)\n• Double-click Employee/Model/Pallet/Weight values → jump to that step\n\nRight Panel: Full PalletInfoDisplay\n• 4-col × 7-row tableLayoutPanel\n• Combo shows dual values: \"Val1 / Val2\"\n• Labels bold during data entry",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step: SkidDataComplete (DataCollectionSteps = 6)\n\n• Terminal step — no Next button\n• btnPrevious enabled → back to Skid Weight\n• btnSaveAndPrint text varies by variation:\n  - Standard/Combo: \"Print Labels\"\n  - StandardReprint/BoxLabel/MachineNumber/Location: \"Print Label\"\n  - LowVolume/KitClaiming: \"Save\"\n  - StandardExtendedModelNum: \"Print Label\"\n• btnSaveAndPrint.Enabled = no blocking exceptions\n• lblPassFail shows PASS/FAIL (visible in history/reprint)\n• Double-click Employee/Model/Pallet/Weight values → jump to that step\n\nRight Panel: Full PalletInfoDisplay\n• 4-col × 7-row tableLayoutPanel\n• Combo shows dual values: \"Val1 / Val2\"\n• Labels bold during data entry",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "annotation-save-print",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 366,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1015,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1015,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "On Save/Print (btnSaveAndPrint_Click):\n\n1. Validate: no blocking exceptions\n2. Switch on variation:\n   • Standard → PrintLabels(skid, unitRecord, null) → methodToCallToRefresh()\n   • StandardExtendedModelNum → PrintLabels(skid2, unitRecord, null) → refresh\n   • Combo → PrintLabels(skid1) + PrintLabels(skid2) → ShowMainMenu()\n   • BoxLabel → PrintBoxLabels() → ShowMainMenu()\n   • MachineNumber → PrintMachineNumber() → ShowMainMenu()\n   • Location → PrintLocation() → ShowMainMenu()\n   • LowVolume/KitClaiming → no print → ShowMainMenu()\n   • StandardReprint → SaveReprintInfoToDb + PrintLabels(skid, unitRecord, reprintRec) → ShowMainMenu()\n   • Combo (history) → both skids with reprintRec\n\n3. After success → methodToCallToRefresh() → AfterSave() → Form1_Load() → ShowMainMenu()\n4. Idle timeout on this screen → auto-triggers AfterSave()",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "On Save/Print (btnSaveAndPrint_Click):\n\n1. Validate: no blocking exceptions\n2. Switch on variation:\n   • Standard → PrintLabels(skid, unitRecord, null) → methodToCallToRefresh()\n   • StandardExtendedModelNum → PrintLabels(skid2, unitRecord, null) → refresh\n   • Combo → PrintLabels(skid1) + PrintLabels(skid2) → ShowMainMenu()\n   • BoxLabel → PrintBoxLabels() → ShowMainMenu()\n   • MachineNumber → PrintMachineNumber() → ShowMainMenu()\n   • Location → PrintLocation() → ShowMainMenu()\n   • LowVolume/KitClaiming → no print → ShowMainMenu()\n   • StandardReprint → SaveReprintInfoToDb + PrintLabels(skid, unitRecord, reprintRec) → ShowMainMenu()\n   • Combo (history) → both skids with reprintRec\n\n3. After success → methodToCallToRefresh() → AfterSave() → Form1_Load() → ShowMainMenu()\n4. Idle timeout on this screen → auto-triggers AfterSave()",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "annotation-history",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 366,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
