      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "History / Reprint mode (InHistoryMode=true):\n• No DB writes for Standard/Combo\n• StandardReprint: reprintRec saved, prints from history\n• StandardExtendedModelNum: prints skid2 only\n• Combo history: both skids with separate reprintRec\n• StandardReprint: ShowMainMenu() after print\n• Combo history: ShowMainMenu() after both prints\n• btnClear HIDDEN in history mode\n• lblPassFail VISIBLE in history/reprint",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "History / Reprint mode (InHistoryMode=true):\n• No DB writes for Standard/Combo\n• StandardReprint: reprintRec saved, prints from history\n• StandardExtendedModelNum: prints skid2 only\n• Combo history: both skids with separate reprintRec\n• StandardReprint: ShowMainMenu() after print\n• Combo history: ShowMainMenu() after both prints\n• btnClear HIDDEN in history mode\n• lblPassFail VISIBLE in history/reprint",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
