      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⚠ Terminal step — NO Next button\n• Previous → back to Skid Weight (enabled)\n• Double-click Employee/Model/Pallet/Weight in right panel → jumps to that step\n• Idle timeout → auto-triggers AfterSave() → back to Main Menu\n• AfterSave() = Form1_Load() → ShowMainMenu() → resets for next skid",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⚠ Terminal step — NO Next button\n• Previous → back to Skid Weight (enabled)\n• Double-click Employee/Model/Pallet/Weight in right panel → jumps to that step\n• Idle timeout → auto-triggers AfterSave() → back to Main Menu\n• AfterSave() = Form1_Load() → ShowMainMenu() → resets for next skid",
